   "id": "seg-01",
   "spk": "Alex",
   "en": "The merge is done. Today we look at a famous open source project. Leo tells me a story about the IP address. Maria explains the localhost to me. I fork a repository, and Maria checks it. Now I understand the star a project. Leo says, \"It's sunny today.\" so I answer, \"It looks like rain.\" The day is busy, but I learn a lot.",
   "tts": "The merge is done. Today we look at a famous open source project. Leo tells me a story about the I P address. Maria explains the local host to me. I fork a repository, and Maria checks it. Now I understand the star a project. Leo says, \"It's sunny today.\" so I answer, \"It looks like rain.\" The day is busy, but I learn a lot.",
   "audio_file": "audio/seg-01.mp3",
   "zh": "合并完成了。今天我们研究一个著名的开源项目。Leo 给我讲了一个关于IP 地址的小故事。Maria 给我讲解本地主机。我复刻仓库，Maria 来检查。现在我理解了给项目加星。Leo说：\"今天阳光很好。\"于是我回答：\"看起来要下雨。\"这天很忙，但我学到了很多。",
   "hard": [
    {
     "w": "IP address",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "IP 地址，用来定位网络中设备的数字地址"
    },
    {
     "w": "localhost",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "本地主机，表示当前这台电脑"
    },
    {
     "w": "It's sunny today.",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "今天阳光很好。"
    },
    {
     "w": "It looks like rain.",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "看起来要下雨。"
    },
    {
     "w": "fork a repository",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "复刻仓库，在自己账号下创建项目副本"
    },
    {
     "w": "star a project",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "给项目加星，表示收藏或支持"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "seg-02",
   "spk": "Alex",
   "en": "The weather is nice, and we chat at the window. During our chat, Maria says, \"It's getting colder.\" I answer, \"The weather is nice.\" I learn about the port number because it is useful. Now I understand the network interface. I watch a repository carefully. I ask one question about the follower. I understand a little more than yesterday.",
   "tts": "The weather is nice, and we chat at the window. During our chat, Maria says, \"It's getting colder.\" I answer, \"The weather is nice.\" I learn about the port number because it is useful. Now I understand the network interface. I watch a repository carefully. I ask one question about the follower. I understand a little more than yesterday.",
   "audio_file": "audio/seg-02.mp3",
   "zh": "天气不错，我们在窗边聊天。聊天时，Maria说：\"天气正在变冷。\"我回答：\"天气不错。\"我学习端口号，因为它很有用。现在我理解了网络接口。我认真地关注仓库。我问了一个关于关注者的问题。我比昨天多懂了一点。",
