  {
   "id": "seg-03",
   "spk": "Alex",
   "en": "Before I leave, I finish one last task. Leo tells me a story about the activity feed. Maria explains the notification setting to me. I learn about the private address because it is useful. Now I understand the public address. Leo says, \"How was your weekend?\" so I answer, \"What have you been up to?\" I star the project and follow its updates.",
   "tts": "Before I leave, I finish one last task. Leo tells me a story about the activity feed. Maria explains the notification setting to me. I learn about the private address because it is useful. Now I understand the public address. Leo says, \"How was your weekend?\" so I answer, \"What have you been up to?\" I star the project and follow its updates.",
   "audio_file": "audio/seg-03.mp3",
   "zh": "离开前，我完成最后一项任务。Leo 给我讲了一个关于活动信息流的小故事。Maria 给我讲解通知设置。我学习私有地址，因为它很有用。现在我理解了公网地址。Leo说：\"你周末过得怎么样？\"于是我回答：\"你最近在忙什么？\"我给项目点了星，并关注它的动态。",
